# Private PvP Lobbies (Phase 5B.1)

- Laravel alone owns invitation eligibility (level ≥ 6), membership, room state, and XP authority.
- Node is transport only. Publish notification hints after DB commit; never compute combat or XP here.
- Room WebSocket access requires one-use Redis subscription grants. `connection.ready` is not room auth.
- Invitees are resolved by exact normalized `PlayerProfile.handle` only — no open user search.
- `features.pvp` stays false until combat ships. Lobby leave/cancel must not award XP/win/loss.
- Prefer Idempotency-Key header; also accept body `idempotency_key` for SPA/mobile clients.
- Fail closed when Redis grant/publish stores are unavailable.
